			"Message": "style(Grove): Revert blank line formatting across source files\n\nRemove the blank lines after struct, enum, and impl block definitions that were added in the previous formatting pass. The vertical spacing changes introduced in 2f265d5a4093 are reverted to restore the original compact formatting style across API types, VSCode facade, common errors and traits, protocol spine client, configuration service, transport adapter, and integration tests.\n\nThis returns the codebase to its prior formatting convention with no functional behavior changes.",
